# Private registry auth for hosted billing. `@talesofai-billing/sdk` is an
# optional *runtime* dependency (billing simply disables itself when it is
# absent), but it is a required *build-time* dependency for the billing and
# space-commerce code paths — typechecking and building `@cohub/billing` and
# `apps/api` will fail without it.
#
# Append these lines to a local .npmrc (or inject in CI).
#
# @talesofai-billing:registry=https://git.talesofai.com/api/packages/talesofai/npm/
# //git.talesofai.com/api/packages/talesofai/npm/:_authToken=${GITEA_NPM_TOKEN}
